  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">More Autonomy for Refugees and Their Hosts</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the proposed project is to improve food security for particularly vulnerable households in the Diffa region through activities such as: Cash for work, unconditional cash, distribution of goats, garden in bags, distribution of seeds and fertilizers, training on the use of resources. The project objective is to improve food and nutrition security for refugees, displaced persons, returnees and host families in three municipalities through the production of agricultural livelihoods and cash transfers.</narrative>
  </description>
